Server init.
>> a := Blob nýtt: 4.
a bytes: ( Listi nýtt ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nýtt: 4.
b bytes: ( Listi nýtt ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a nýtt.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Úttak skrifa: ['xorred:'], ný-lína. 
Úttak skrifa: n, ný-lína. 
} grípa: { :e Úttak skrifa: e, ný-lína. }, ræsa.
a losa.
b losa.
